  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for the Strengthening of Fiscal Policy and Public Financial Management in Guatemala</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa para el Fortalecimiento de la Poltica Fiscal y la Gestin de las Finanzas Pblicas de Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">El objetivo general de desarrollo del programa es contribuir al fortalecimiento de la gestin fiscal en Guatemala. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) aumentar la eficiencia de la administracin tributaria; (ii) mejorar la eficiencia del gasto pblico; y (iii) modernizar la planificacin fiscal</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The programs overall development objective is to contribute to strengthening fiscal management in Guatemala. The specific objectives are: (i) to increase the efficiency of tax administration; (ii) to improve the efficiency of public expenditure; and (iii) to modernize fiscal planning.</narrative>
  </description>
